    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Faraway Lands: Rise of Yokai is a unique side-scrolling base-building and survival game set in mystical feudal Japan. As the newly appointed lord, grow your settlement into a stronghold and withstand relentless Yokai assaults under the cover of night. Recruit diverse immigrants with unique traits, explore uncharted territories, forge new alliances, and shape the destiny of a realm torn between light and darkness. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1303940/extras/67ec1b7dcd2f928a344a478cd80bf617.webp?t=1754663492\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1303940/extras/87756a44e604f915debdcd144db8fbad.poster.avif?t=1754663492\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1303940/extras/87756a44e604f915debdcd144db8fbad.webm?t=1754663492\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1303940/extras/87756a44e604f915debdcd144db8fbad.mp4?t=1754663492\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Strategically utilize the unique mountainous terrain to create a visually stunning and effective town, offering a fresh twist for fans of base-building games. Each structure you build and upgrade brings new possibilities and challenges. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1303940/extras/bf95adef3859d813e60843403dab95b4.webp?t=1754663492\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1303940/extras/02c8ee3fc25975c70d267ced67a12900.poster.avif?t=1754663492\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1303940/extras/02c8ee3fc25975c70d267ced67a12900.webm?t=1754663492\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1303940/extras/02c8ee3fc25975c70d267ced67a12900.mp4?t=1754663492\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Advance your settlement with a dynamic research system driven by scholars in pagodas. Progress through tiered advancements to unlock powerful upgrades that shape your town\u2019s future. Randomized research options keep every playthrough fresh, while focusing on specific areas lets you tailor your strategy to adapt and thrive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1303940/extras/4851b22c71a7567c41f8b7c2a2a3eb24.webp?t=1754663492\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1303940/extras/f1ae99a4d4b64f3511f0d82e14a1b021.poster.avif?t=1754663492\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1303940/extras/f1ae99a4d4b64f3511f0d82e14a1b021.webm?t=1754663492\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1303940/extras/f1ae99a4d4b64f3511f0d82e14a1b021.mp4?t=1754663492\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each villager in your game is unique, possessing distinct traits that affect their abilities and efficiency. Skillfully assign them to various jobs \u2013 from resource gathering to crafting \u2013 to maximize your town's productivity. Balance is key \u2013 ensure your villagers are well-fed, healthy, and happy to maintain efficiency and growth. Watch your town transform from a simple settlement into a thriving community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1303940/extras/8f06e67a96835a086821a3e4d21a67a1.webp?t=1754663492\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1303940/extras/a49ebd3b987e28fab29a691480bfe947.poster.avif?t=1754663492\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1303940/extras/a49ebd3b987e28fab29a691480bfe947.webm?t=1754663492\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1303940/extras/a49ebd3b987e28fab29a691480bfe947.mp4?t=1754663492\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As night falls, your strategic skills are put to the test against the terrifying Yokai. Train a diverse range of soldiers, from mighty Samurai wielding deadly katana to mystical Onmy\u014dji who can control spirits, and lead them in defending your town. Hire skilled mercenaries, bringing their unique talents to your town's defense. Strategically deploy soldiers to guard your town's perimeters. Each night is a test of your defensive tactics and resilience. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1303940/extras/50e0f5e29482afb2669cd31040a75a4c.webp?t=1754663492\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1303940/extras/8b4dcb33ba301c666fffec40e495f2f2.poster.avif?t=1754663492\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1303940/extras/8b4dcb33ba301c666fffec40e495f2f2.webm?t=1754663492\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1303940/extras/8b4dcb33ba301c666fffec40e495f2f2.mp4?t=1754663492\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sail beyond your borders into a vast world of discovery. Chart unknown territories, encounter pirates, and unveil secret islands. Establish trade routes with new countries, enriching your base with rare resources and exotic rewards. Go beyond the surface and delve deep underground to unearth precious ores, mysterious caves, and secrets that lie beneath your town. What you find may just give you the edge you need to turn the tide against the Yokai. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1303940/extras/d1a3cd0f521c6ce1fbb4e9ae5c470649.webp?t=1754663492\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1303940/extras/3842dcde5fd11ad2d39475fba4400d55.poster.avif?t=1754663492\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1303940/extras/3842dcde5fd11ad2d39475fba4400d55.webm?t=1754663492\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1303940/extras/3842dcde5fd11ad2d39475fba4400d55.mp4?t=1754663492\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience a world alive with dynamic weather and changing seasons, each bringing its own set of challenges and beauty. Brace your town against natural disasters that test your management skills. How will you adapt to the whims of nature? </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1303940/extras/1133c4d0f4c173e927fce2b87c82d063.avif?t=1754663492\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1303940/extras/22600a59834a0c52b086eefea6a55456.poster.avif?t=1754663492\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1303940/extras/22600a59834a0c52b086eefea6a55456.webm?t=1754663492\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1303940/extras/22600a59834a0c52b086eefea6a55456.mp4?t=1754663492\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize your run by selecting a path that grants unique bonuses and gameplay style. Enhance your town further with powerful relics that introduce new mechanics. Tweak world and difficulty settings to tailor every playthrough to your preferences. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1303940/extras/20d9ee8231f5ddf8ad9921f4cb4bbc7f.webp?t=1754663492\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1303940/extras/29cb1b0e33a2227aa88477da25bd50d1.poster.avif?t=1754663492\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1303940/extras/29cb1b0e33a2227aa88477da25bd50d1.webm?t=1754663492\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1303940/extras/29cb1b0e33a2227aa88477da25bd50d1.mp4?t=1754663492\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create not just a functional town, but also a breathtaking one in a rich pixel-art style. Utilize a wide array of decorations to add beauty and charm to your town. From bonsai to ornate statues, each addition makes your town more distinct and visually stunning. </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Faraway Lands: Rise of Yokai is a unique side-scrolling base-building and survival game set in mystical feudal Japan. As the newly appointed lord, grow your settlement into a stronghold and withstand relentless Yokai assaults under the cover of night. Recruit diverse immigrants with unique traits, explore uncharted territories, forge new alliances, and shape the destiny of a realm torn between light and darkness. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1303940/extras/67ec1b7dcd2f928a344a478cd80bf617.webp?t=1754663492\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1303940/extras/87756a44e604f915debdcd144db8fbad.poster.avif?t=1754663492\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1303940/extras/87756a44e604f915debdcd144db8fbad.webm?t=1754663492\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1303940/extras/87756a44e604f915debdcd144db8fbad.mp4?t=1754663492\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Strategically utilize the unique mountainous terrain to create a visually stunning and effective town, offering a fresh twist for fans of base-building games. Each structure you build and upgrade brings new possibilities and challenges. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1303940/extras/bf95adef3859d813e60843403dab95b4.webp?t=1754663492\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1303940