n transform from a simple settlement into a thriving community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1303940/extras/8f06e67a96835a086821a3e4d21a67a1.webp?t=1754663492\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1303940/extras/a49ebd3b987e28fab29a691480bfe947.poster.avif?t=1754663492\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1303940/extras/a49ebd3b987e28fab29a691480bfe947.webm?t=1754663492\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1303940/extras/a49ebd3b987e28fab29a691480bfe947.mp4?t=1754663492\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As night falls, your strategic skills are put to the test against the terrifying Yokai. Train a diverse range of soldiers, from mighty Samurai wielding deadly katana to mystical Onmy\u014dji who can control spirits, and lead them in defending your town. Hire skilled mercenaries, bringing their unique talents to your town's defense. Strategically deploy soldiers to guard your town's perimeters. Each night is a test of your defensive tactics and resilience. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1303940/extras/50e0f5e29482afb2669cd31040a75a4c.webp?t=1754663492\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1303940/extras/8b4dcb33ba301c666fffec40e495f2f2.poster.avif?t=1754663492\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/